#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/xr1710g_proxy/proxy.js:144
msgid ""
"Failing open is deliberate: if the proxy core dies, proxy clients fall back "
"to direct routing instead of losing connectivity, which matches the rule "
"that a failure must never affect normal networking. The trade-off is that "
"during a fault those clients are not proxied, which is stated here "
"explicitly."
msgstr ""

