msgstr ""

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/xr1710g_proxy/proxy.js:66
msgid ""
"Hard constraint of this architecture: fake-IP may only be handed to proxy "
"clients. Ordinary clients always receive real IPs. If an ordinary client "
"received 198.18.x, the kernel allow-rule (which only matches proxy clients) "
"would never let it out, so foreign sites would be unreachable rather than "
"merely slow."
msgstr ""

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/xr1710g_proxy/proxy.js:135
msgid "Installed"
msgstr ""

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/xr1710g_proxy/proxy.js:42
msgid ""
"Kernel-level classification. Only clients on the proxy list are captured "
"into userspace; all other clients stay on the original forwarding path with "
"hardware offload fully preserved. Disabled by default. On start failure or "
"process crash it fails open by removing the capture and redirect rules, so "
"the proxy clients fall back to direct routing and normal networking is never "
"affected."
msgstr ""

